<rml>
<head>
<title>Terrain laboratory</title>
<style>
body, div, h1 { display: block; }
body { margin: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; pointer-events: none; font-family: body; color: #f2f5ec; font-size: 15px; }
.panel { position: absolute; top: 24px; right: 24px; width: 310px; max-height: 88%; padding: 20px; box-sizing: border-box; background-color: #17272ee8; border-width: 1px; border-color: #526a68; overflow-y: auto; pointer-events: auto; }
.eyebrow { color: #a4d796; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
h1 { font-family: heading; font-weight: normal; font-size: 27px; margin: 0 0 8px 0; }
.intro { color: #bacac7; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.section { color: #a4d796; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 1px; margin: 16px 0 7px 0; }
.buttons { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; }
button { display: block; tab-index: auto; width: 47%; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 3% 7px 0; padding: 10px 8px; font-family: body; font-size: 13px; text-align: center; color: #f2f5ec; background-color: #344b50; border-width: 1px; border-color: #526a68; }
button:hover, button:focus { background-color: #4b6868; border-color: #b3ddb0; }
button.selected { background-color: #65906c; color: #ffffff; }
button:disabled { color: #84928e; background-color: #273a3d; }
#terrain-statistics { color: #a3c8d0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4; margin: 14px 0 8px 0; }
#terrain-status { color: #e6eee0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; }
.footnote { color: #9aaca8; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.4; margin-top: 14px; }
scrollbarvertical { width: 8px; background-color: #17272e; }
scrollbarvertical slidertrack { width: 8px; }
scrollbarvertical sliderbar { width: 6px; margin: 1px; min-height: 20px; background-color: #65906c; }
scrollbarvertical sliderarrowdec, scrollbarvertical sliderarrowinc { display: none; }
@media (max-width: 700px) { .panel { top: 74px; right: 12px; width: 228px; padding: 12px; max-height: 74%; } h1 { font-size: 22px; } button { font-size: 12px; padding: 8px 5px; } .intro { font-size: 12px; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="panel">
    <div class="eyebrow">SHOWCASE / VOLUME STUDY</div>
    <h1>Terrain laboratory</h1>
    <div class="intro">One editable volume. Hills, underground space and physical collision.</div>
    <div class="section">MODIFY THE LAND</div>
    <div class="buttons">
        <button id="terrain-dig">Extend tunnel</button>
        <button id="terrain-blast">Blast crater</button>
        <button id="terrain-fill">Fill entrance</button>
        <button id="terrain-reset">Reset terrain</button>
    </div>
    <div class="section">KEEP YOUR CHANGES</div>
    <div class="buttons">
        <button id="terrain-save">Save locally</button>
        <button id="terrain-load">Restore save</button>
    </div>
    <div class="section">INSPECT THE RESULT</div>
    <div class="buttons">
        <button id="terrain-overview" class="selected">Overview</button>
        <button id="terrain-cave">Cave view</button>
        <button id="terrain-walk">Walk</button>
        <button id="terrain-respawn">Return to start</button>
    </div>
    <div id="terrain-statistics">Preparing volume...</div>
    <div id="terrain-status">Preparing the terrain mesh and collision...</div>
    <div class="footnote">64 x 64 m / 32 m volume height<br/>Cyan stakes: z = 0 chunk seam.<br/>Walk: WASD / Space / right mouse / Tab.<br/>Touch supports the lab buttons; walking uses keyboard and mouse.</div>
</div>
</body>
</rml>
